# Checks after Go edits

Format with `make format`, or `gofmt` on the files you touched. When behavior changed, run `make test`. `go build -v ./` checks that the package compiles. `make build` also generates docs, tidies modules, and runs `gosec` and `deadcode`; that is the release check. `make lint` runs `trunk check --all` and pre-commit.
